## Overview

As Design Lead on the if(we) Labs team, I led art direction, heuristics, roadmap, and design for Sidewalk, a new standalone product, and shaped its definition with directors and the executive team.

The work covered the iOS and Android apps, a watercolor-based visual identity, posters, apparel, advertising, and a media kit.
